  "Question": "In square \\(ABCD\\), rotate \\(\\triangle ADF\\) through \\(90^\\circ\\) about point \\(A\\) so that \\(AD\\) coincides with \\(AB\\). The point corresponding to \\(F\\) is \\(F'\\). If \\(DF=3\\), find the length of \\(BF'\\).",
  "Choices": {},
  "Correct Answer": "3",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "Corresponding segments before and after a rotation have equal lengths, so \\(BF'=DF=3\\).",
